> Compatibility Testing :
=> Checking the application behaviour on multiple operating systems, browsers and versions.


> Web-Application : 
=> any application we are accessing on browser , and it is connected with internet. so call it as Web Application.


> How compatibility testing can be performed ?
-> Practically it is not possible to perform in one machine so we use third party applications/tools to go for it.

The leading application for compatibility is browserstack.
https://live.browserstack.com/
SOW : Statement Of Work 


=> Use browserStack for compatibility Testing.
-> Here we can go for older versions also.


> Localization Testing : 
=> Checking the application content(Language) and currency of the application from which the customer is accessing it.
